This addon is a collection for settings and bits of code from other addons that
I've made over the years that are now rolled into here.

Features
  Unitframes
    - Moves the unitframes to the center of the screen, under the character.
    - Moves the castingbar on top of the player and target unitframes.

  Slashcommands
    - Adds slashcommand /rl for reloading the interface.

  Tooltips
    - Anchors the tooltip to the mouse.

  CVars (blizzard settings)
    - Sets the max camera distance to the max value (30)

  Minimap
    - Removes all buttons around the minimap, leaving a clean round frame.
    - Zoom in and out with the mousewheel.
    - Track trings with the right mouse button.

